swap face_0.json

# ── Duplicate / third-party directories (not project source) ──
ComfyUI-ReActor-main/
OpenCV-android-sdk/
new_clip/

# ── Large model binaries (NOT tracked — download via scripts/download_models.sh) ──
# Small config files (vocab.json, merges.txt, tokenizer_config.json, inference.yml)
# are kept in their edition source set — only large model binaries are excluded.
# Shared interactive face-swap models remain in main so Full and Lite can package them.
app/src/main/assets/models/*.onnx
app/src/main/assets/models/*.bin
app/src/main/assets/models/*.zip
app/src/main/assets/models/*.tflite
app/src/main/assets/models/*.ptl
# Semantic/OCR model binaries are Full-only and must never be sourced from main.
app/src/full/assets/models/eva02_clip/*.onnx
app/src/full/assets/models/PP-OCRv5_mobile_rec_infer/*.onnx
app/src/full/assets/models/PP-OCRv6_small_det_infer/*.onnx
# 例外：MobileNetV3 场景分类模型随包打包（~21MB），需纳入版本控制
!app/src/main/assets/models/MobileNet-v3-Large.tflite
.zcode/